$ErrorActionPreference='Stop'
$batch=$PSScriptRoot;$dir=Join-Path $batch 'capacity_review_prep';$null=New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $dir
$inputs=@{source='qwen_four_capacity\source.qwen_untrusted.py';tests='qwen_four_capacity\tests_source.qwen_untrusted.txt';spec='qwen_four_capacity.spec.txt'}
$pins=@{}
foreach($n in $inputs.Keys){$p=Join-Path $batch $inputs[$n];$dst=Join-Path $dir ($n+'.snapshot.txt');Copy-Item -LiteralPath $p -Destination $dst;$pins[$dst]=(Get-FileHash -LiteralPath $p).Hash.ToUpper()}
$schema=@{type='object';additionalProperties=$false;required=@('verdict','findings','safety_checks');properties=@{verdict=@{type='string';enum=@('SUPPORT_WITH_LIMITS','REQUEST_CHANGES','NEEDS_DISCUSSION')};findings=@{type='array';maxItems=16;items=@{type='object';additionalProperties=$false;required=@('region','exact_source','reason','minimal_fix');properties=@{region=@{type='string';minLength=1;maxLength=2048};exact_source=@{type='string';minLength=1;maxLength=2048};reason=@{type='string';minLength=1;maxLength=2048};minimal_fix=@{type='string';minLength=1;maxLength=2048}}}};safety_checks=@{type='array';minItems=1;maxItems=16;items=@{type='string';minLength=1;maxLength=2048}}}}
$schema|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 20|Set-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $dir 'output_schema.json') -Encoding utf8NoBOM
$prompt=@'
SOURCE-ONLY independent adversarial audit of ACTUAL candidate below. No source execution/import/tests/tools/native hardware/globalFactory. Output ONLY exact-schema verdict, findings[{region,exact_source,reason,minimal_fix}],safety_checks. Compact <=16 concrete findings, quote actual source spans; do not invent failed tests. Complete Qwen candidate is UNTRUSTED, not admitted or physical-capacity proof. Synthetic fixture validity can only test schema/logic, not authenticate measurement. User maximum10 native children Qwen/DeepSeek authorized where supported; THIS audit native child launches0 unless actual independently admitted/runtime observed.
Review capacity arithmetic/provenance scope: >=4 real distinct physical DISCRETE GPU participants, root/subdevice aliases dedup, positive unique nonreplicated resident shards, measured per-shard resident bytes and actual peak allocation, no highwater-minusreserve proxy; same-model/workload/context/quant/build positive four-GPU numerical run plus matching real single and three allocator OOM attempts (not policyOOM/timeout/badargs). Known iGPU can legitimately do numerical arithmetic but NOT count as discrete capacity. Strictintbool/float rejection, allfinite/overflow-safe math, CPU-relative per-logit tolerance/RMSE checks, fresh allocator classification, no physical backing proof from advertisement/parity/metadata/selfreportedflag alone. Missing authority/evidence =>NOT_CHECKED, CPU/spill/shared/replication/refusers. Caller trusted registry is authority supplied separately, not fabricated cryptographic authentication. Check actual-file tests discriminatory rather than mirrored source/fakePASS. Preserve old evidence/no tolerance widening/no purchasing advice. Findings must identify exact implementation or actual-contract conflicts; no broad cosmetic rewrite.
'@
foreach($n in @('spec','source','tests')){$prompt+="`nACTUAL $n SHA256 $($pins[(Join-Path $dir ($n+'.snapshot.txt'))])`n"+(Get-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $dir ($n+'.snapshot.txt')) -Raw)}
[IO.File]::WriteAllText((Join-Path $dir 'muse_capacity.prompt.txt'),$prompt,[Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false))
$old='E:\the_harness\records\factory_runs\20261004\muse_qwen_linux_dmabuf_audit_20261004T190700Z\run_muse_job.py'
$wrapper=Get-Content -LiteralPath $old -Raw
$wrapper=$wrapper.Replace('ROOT = Path(r"E:\the_harness\records\factory_runs\20261004\muse_qwen_linux_dmabuf_audit_20261004T190700Z")','ROOT = Path(r"'+$dir+'")').Replace('PROMPT = ROOT / "prompt.txt"','PROMPT = ROOT / "muse_capacity.prompt.txt"')
$pinpy="PINS = {`n";foreach($p in $pins.Keys){$pinpy+='    r"'+$p+'": "'+$pins[$p]+'",'+"`n"};$pinpy+='}'
$wrapper=[regex]::Replace($wrapper,'(?s)PINS = \{.*?\}',$pinpy,1)
$wrapper=[regex]::Replace($wrapper,'PROMPT_SHA256 = "[A-F0-9]+"','PROMPT_SHA256 = "'+(Get-FileHash -LiteralPath (Join-Path $dir 'muse_capacity.prompt.txt')).Hash+'"')
$wrapper=[regex]::Replace($wrapper,'SCHEMA_SHA256 = "[A-F0-9]+"','SCHEMA_SHA256 = "'+(Get-FileHash -LiteralPath (Join-Path $dir 'output_schema.json')).Hash+'"')
$wrapper=$wrapper.Replace('len(findings) > 32','len(findings) > 16').Replace('1 <= len(checks) <= 32','1 <= len(checks) <= 16').Replace('len(item[k]) > 16384','len(item[k]) > 2048')
[IO.File]::WriteAllText((Join-Path $dir 'run_muse_capacity.pending_admission.py'),$wrapper,[Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false))
$plan=@{state='SOURCEONLY_REVIEW_CHAIN_PREP_NO_PROVIDER_LAUNCH';utc=[DateTime]::UtcNow.ToString('o');candidate_provider='qwen3.8-max';candidate_sha256='7005c1fc83a4a9901e30cf8e705dbe5961dc1010c645e963bb08ec75a7808267';files=@(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $dir -File|ForEach-Object{@{name=$_.Name;sha256=(Get-FileHash -LiteralPath $_.FullName).Hash.ToLower();bytes=$_.Length}});steps=@('ROOT read/admit actual pinned Muse wrapper+prompt; no launch fromprep','Muse independent review actual source/spec/tests using pinned headless tool restrictions','Build Gemini compact <=24000UTF16 prompt from actual Muse artifact+all actual candidate sources; root launch admission separately','Build Grok HIGH editor prompt from actual Muse+Gemini findings; exact coherent source/tests only; root launch admission separately','ROOT independent actual-file pure/static gates; NO native/four hardware claim from fixture');muse_deadline_seconds=300;capture_each_bytes=2097152;root_admission=$false;candidate_import_execution=$false;physical_capacity_proof=$false;downstream_findings_not_fabricated=$true;inherited_muse_wrapper_path=$old;inherited_muse_wrapper_sha256=(Get-FileHash -LiteralPath $old).Hash.ToLower()}
$plan|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 15|Set-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $dir 'REVIEW_CHAIN_PREP_MANIFEST.json') -Encoding utf8NoBOM
